{
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_TERRARIA_REUNION.title": "久别重逢",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_TERRARIA_REUNION.pages.INITIAL.description": "你遇见了一位熟悉的身影。\n\n「嘿！终于又见到你了，我的朋友！」\n\n[gold]向导[/gold]高兴地走了过来。\n\n「没想到你去了另一个世界！我这里还留着你以前的几件饰品，虽然只能带走一件，但应该能帮上你的忙。」",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_TERRARIA_REUNION.pages.CHOSEN.description": "向导微笑着看你收好饰品。\n\n「希望你有一天能回到泰拉瑞亚的家。我和大家都很想念你。」",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_TERRARIA_REUNION.pages.LEAVE.description": "你向老朋友道别，继续踏上旅途。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_TERRARIA_REUNION.pages.INITIAL.options.LEAVE.title": "离开",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_TERRARIA_REUNION.pages.INITIAL.options.LEAVE.description": "继续前进。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_SWORD_IN_THE_LAKE.title": "湖中剑",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_SWORD_IN_THE_LAKE.pages.INITIAL.description": "你来到一片宁静的湖泊。腰间的剑忽然发出微弱的光芒。\n\n湖面泛起涟漪，一位神秘的女子缓缓浮现。\n\n「你手中的剑，似乎还隐藏着真正的力量。你愿意唤醒它吗？」",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_SWORD_IN_THE_LAKE.pages.STONE_AWAKENED.description": "湖水环绕剑身，逐渐凝聚成一柄崭新的圣剑。\n\n「愿这把剑为你扫清前方的障碍。」\n\n你获得了[gold]【誓约胜利之剑】[/gold]。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_SWORD_IN_THE_LAKE.pages.JADE_AWAKENED.description": "耀眼的金光从剑身迸发，湖面映照出圣剑真正的姿态。\n\n「看来，你已经拥有驾驭它的力量了。」\n\n你获得了[gold]【真·誓约胜利之剑】[/gold]。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_SWORD_IN_THE_LAKE.pages.LEAVE.description": "你收起长剑，继续踏上旅途。\n\n身后的湖面再次恢复平静。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_SWORD_IN_THE_LAKE.pages.INITIAL.options.LEAVE.title": "离开",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_SWORD_IN_THE_LAKE.pages.INITIAL.options.LEAVE.description": "保留原有遗物。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_DRAGON_BALL_TRAINING.title": "异世界的武道修行",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_DRAGON_BALL_TRAINING.pages.INITIAL.description": "你来到一片陌生的修行场。三位散发着强大气息的身影注意到了你。\n\n其中一人开口说道：\n\n「虽然不知道你为什么来到这里，但看你好像需要帮助。我们可以教授你我们的【绝学】。」",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_DRAGON_BALL_TRAINING.pages.LEARNED.description": "经过一番指导，你掌握了新的招式。\n\n临走前，其中一位老师将一副奇怪的仪器交给你。\n\n「这是战斗力探测器，可以看见敌人的战斗力。不过，它并不是百分之百准确的，别太依赖它。」\n\n获得所选技能牌。\n\n获得【战斗力探测器】。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_DRAGON_BALL_TRAINING.pages.INITIAL.options.KRILLIN.title": "向克林求教",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_DRAGON_BALL_TRAINING.pages.INITIAL.options.KRILLIN.description": "学习【{Skill}】。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_DRAGON_BALL_TRAINING.pages.INITIAL.options.PICCOLO.title": "向比克求教",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_DRAGON_BALL_TRAINING.pages.INITIAL.options.PICCOLO.description": "学习【{Skill}】。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_DRAGON_BALL_TRAINING.pages.INITIAL.options.KING_KAI.title": "向界王求教",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_DRAGON_BALL_TRAINING.pages.INITIAL.options.KING_KAI.description": "学习【{Skill}】。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_GOLDEN_AXE.title": "樵夫之泉",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_GOLDEN_AXE.pages.INITIAL.description": "你没有回答，转身离去。\n\n女神愣了一下，随后消失在湖水中。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_GOLDEN_AXE.pages.INITIAL_RELIC.description": "路过一片湖泊时，你不慎将[gold]{Item}[/gold]掉入水中。\n\n一位女神从湖中浮现，手中拿着一件闪闪发光的[gold]金色遗物[/gold]。\n\n「旅行者，你掉的是这件[gold]金色的{Item}[/gold]，还是破旧的[gold]{Item}[/gold]呢？」",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_GOLDEN_AXE.pages.INITIAL_CARD.description": "一阵风吹过，你的[gold]{Item}[/gold]飘进湖中。\n\n一位女神从水中浮现，手中拿着一张[gold]金色卡牌[/gold]和一张银色卡牌。\n\n「旅行者，你掉的是这张[gold]金色的卡牌[/gold]，还是这张银色的卡牌呢？」",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_GOLDEN_AXE.pages.HONEST.description": "女神满意地点了点头。\n\n「诚实的旅行者，这些就作为你的奖励吧！」",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_GOLDEN_AXE.pages.DISHONEST.description": "女神皱起眉头，将原本的物品还给了你。\n\n「愧疚可不是什么好习惯。」",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_GOLDEN_AXE.pages.LEAVE.description": "你没有回答，转身离去。\n\n女神愣了一下，随后消失在湖水中。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_GOLDEN_AXE.pages.INITIAL.options.LEAVE.title": "离开",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_GOLDEN_AXE.pages.INITIAL.options.LEAVE.description": "继续前进。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_GOLDEN_AXE.pages.INITIAL_RELIC.options.HONEST.title": "诚实",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_GOLDEN_AXE.pages.INITIAL_RELIC.options.HONEST.description": "「破旧的那件才是我的。」获得[gold]金色遗物[/gold]。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_GOLDEN_AXE.pages.INITIAL_RELIC.options.DISHONEST.title": "说谎",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_GOLDEN_AXE.pages.INITIAL_RELIC.options.DISHONEST.description": "「[gold]金色的那件[/gold]是我的！」取回原遗物，获得【愧疚】。",
  "OTHERWORLD_TREASURES_EVENT_GOLDEN_AXE.pages.INITIAL_RELIC.options.LEAVE.title": "离开",
